# The GDI score screen after a mission in which men died: the casualty bars,
# which win_mission.script, won before a shot is fired, never fills.
# args: -PLAYTEST
at 301 click 320 58
at 501 click 160 200
at 9000 keydown ALT
at 9001 key W
at 9005 keyup ALT
at 10000 shot casualties
at 10800 shot buildings_lost
at 10801 quit
